For future reference (and I guess if you're successful this next time in
minetown) I take all magic stuff with me first and before that b/u/c id
any sacks/bags to carry all but the wands and bags in - less
encumberance and don't have to worry about the effects thereof. There
*must* be a bag of holding there and if it's cursed, you probably have
something there to uncurse it and maybe bless it too. Look out for other
monsters left over too, say on the other side of town where the rooms
opposite the side you came in are (if it's one of the square town maps
in a box if you follow my meaning). 

